  "description": "Two level balances illustrate subtracting the same 6 kg from both sides of x+6=15. The unknown watermelon remains unlabelled; all source weight values, both balances and four removed weights are retained.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/5m/figures/fig-102.png",
